<BRK/>
<TXT>Provide mill test reports for [structural steel plates, shapes, and bars][structural steel tubing][hot-rolled carbon steel bars][cold-drawn steel 
tubing].  Mill test report will include but is not limited to material heat number, material grade, edition year and type of specification met, 
material dimension, mechanical properties, chemical analysis, heat treatment (if applicable), and certified inspector signature.</TXT><BRK/>
